#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randint.rst:2
msgid "randint"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randint.randint:1
msgid ""
"Returns a tensor filled with random integers generated uniformly between "
"``low`` (inclusive) and ``high`` (exclusive)."
msgstr "``low``\\ （含む）から ``high``\\ （含まない）の間で一様に生成されたランダムな整数で埋められたテンソルを返します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randint.randint:4
msgid ""
"Unlike :func:`torch.randint`, if the seed is fixed with "
":func:`qfeval_functions.random.seed`, the result must be reproducible on "
"any device.  See :func:`rand` for details."
msgstr ""
":func:`torch.randint` と異なり、:func:`qfeval_functions.random.seed` "
"でシードを固定した場合、結果はどのデバイスでも再現可能です。詳細は :func:`rand` を参照してください。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randint.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randint.randint:9
msgid "The lowest integer to be drawn from the distribution (inclusive)."
msgstr "分布から取り出される最小の整数（含む）。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randint.randint:12
msgid ""
"One above the highest integer to be drawn from the distribution "
"(exclusive)."
msgstr "分布から取り出される最大の整数に 1 を加えた値（含まない）。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randint.randint:16
msgid "A tuple defining the shape of the output tensor."
msgstr "出力テンソルの形状を定義するタプル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randint.randint:19
msgid "The desired data type of the returned tensor. Default is ``torch.int64``."
msgstr "返されるテンソルの望ましいデータ型。デフォルトは ``torch.int64`` です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randint.randint:23
msgid ""
"The desired device of the returned tensor. Default uses the current "
"device."
msgstr "返されるテンソルの望ましいデバイス。デフォルトは現在のデバイスを使用します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randint.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randint.randint:27
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A tensor of the given shape filled with random integers in "
":math:`[\\text{low}, \\text{high})`."
msgstr ":math:`[\\text{low}, \\text{high})` のランダムな整数で埋められた、指定された形状のテンソル。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randint.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randint.randint:32
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randint.randint:34
msgid ""
">>> import qfeval_functions\n"
">>> with qfeval_functions.random.seed(1):\n"
"...     x = QF.randint(0, 10, (2, 3))\n"
">>> x\n"
"tensor([[2, 9, 7],\n"
"        [1, 5, 9]])"
msgstr ">>> import qfeval_functions\n>>> with qfeval_functions.random.seed(1):\n...     x = QF.randint(0, 10, (2, 3))\n>>> x\ntensor([[2, 9, 7],\n        [1, 5, 9]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randint.randint:41
msgid ":func:`rand`: Uniform random floats on the interval [0, 1)."
msgstr ":func:`rand`: 区間 [0, 1) 上の一様乱数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randint.randint:42
msgid ":func:`randn`: Standard normal random numbers."
msgstr ":func:`randn`: 標準正規分布に従う乱数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randint.randint:43
msgid ":func:`randperm`: Random permutation of integers."
msgstr ":func:`randperm`: 整数のランダムな順列。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randint.randint:44
msgid "``torch.randint``: PyTorch's built-in random integer generator."
msgstr "``torch.randint``: PyTorch に組み込まれたランダム整数生成関数。"

